rminal Pirate BayComment: 0,0:28:15.00,0:28:18.97,Captions,,0,0,0,,Captain Bluejam Bluejam PiratesDialogue: 0,0:00:03.96,0:00:06.81,Credits,,0,0,0,,Editing SewilDialogue: 0,0:00:06.81,0:00:09.56,Credits,,0,0,0,,Timing Sewil PhosCityDialogue: 0,0:00:09.56,0:00:12.11,Credits,,0,0,0,,Karaoke KaitouYahikoDialogue: 0,0:00:12.11,0:00:15.01,Credits,,0,0,0,,QC Feeso, Galaxy 9000, PepperjackDialogue: 0,0:00:15.01,0:00:17.11,Credits,,0,0,0,,Translation Crunchyroll Funimation GaijinDialogue: 0,0:00:17.11,0:00:18.50,Credits,,0,0,0,,Raws df68Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.45,0:02:36.42,Title,,0,0,230,,Gray TerminalDialogue: 1,0:02:31.45,0:02:36.42,Title,,0,0,230,,Gray TerminalDialogue: 0,0:02:37.49,0:02:40.96,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Ten years ago, in the East Blue,Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.86,0:02:48.68,Narrator,,0,0,0,,people lived in peace in a hamlet called Foosha Village.Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.36,0:02:52.70,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Not far from the village was Mount Colubo, where people seldom ventured.Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.72,0:03:00.76,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Only the strong could survive there. Death awaited the weak.Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.46,0:03:05.48,Main,,0,0,0,,Grandpa, all I'm saying is...Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.20,0:03:08.47,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll be the pirate king.Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.47,0:03:10.74,Main,,0,0,0,,What do you know about the pirate king?!Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.74,0:03:12.91,Main,,0,0,0,,Let me... Let me go!Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.91,0:03:16.78,Main,,0,0,0,,First you eat that devil fruit, and now you're talking nonsense!Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.78,0:03:22.05,Captions,,0,0,0,,Monkey D. Garp         (10 Years Ago)Dialogue: 1,0:03:16.78,0:03:22.05,Captions,,0,0,0,,Monkey D. Garp         (10 Years Ago)Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.78,0:03:22.05,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy, both you and Ace are gonna be strapping marines!Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.05,0:03:24.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Ow, ow, ow, dammit!Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.05,0:03:26.83,Captions,,0,0,0,,Monkey D. Luffy         (10 Years Ago)Dialogue: 1,0:03:22.05,0:03:26.83,Captions,,0,0,0,,Monkey D. Luffy         (10 Years Ago)Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.10,0:03:26.47,Main,,0,0,0,,My body is rubber, but why does this hurt?!Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.47,0:03:28.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Let me go, Grandpa!Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.83,0:03:32.12,Main,,0,0,0,,It was a mistake to leave you in Foosha Village!Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.12,0:03:34.59,Main,,0,0,0,,It just had to be pirates!Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.76,0:03:39.43,Main,,0,0,0,,What's this place?Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.07,0:03:46.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Stop it already! Who dares to pound on my door?!Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.00,0:03:47.07,Main,,0,0,0,,It's me.Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.22,0:03:52.35,Main,,0,0,0,,G-Garp-san!Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.81,0:03:58.28,Captions,,0,0,0,,Curly DadanDialogue: 1,0:03:54.81,0:03:58.28,Captions,,0,0,0,,Curly DadanDialogue: 0,0:03:58.28,0:04:01.72,Captions,,0,0,0,,Dogra, a Mountain BanditDialogue: 1,0:03:58.28,0:04:01.72,Captions,,0,0,0,,Dogra, a Mountain BanditDialogue: 0,0:04:01.72,0:04:05.19,Captions,,0,0,0,,Magra, a Mountain BanditDialogue: 1,0:04:01.72,0:04:05.19,Captions,,0,0,0,,Magra, a Mountain BanditDialogue: 0,0:04:05.19,0:04:06.72,Main,,0,0,0,,You're looking well.Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.72,0:04:11.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Give me a break! Please, you gotta have mercy on me!Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.60,0:04:14.14,Main,,0,0,0,,Ace is 10 years old now!Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.14,0:04:17.77,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, already? How is he?Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.77,0:04:19.92,Main,,0,0,0,,It's not funny!Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.92,0:04:23.73,Main,,0,0,0,,We can't handle him anymore! You have to take him!Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.73,0:04:26.78,Main,,0,0,0,,-Putting that aside... -Don't put it aside!Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.78,0:04:28.68,Main,,0,0,0,,You're annoying, kid!Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.16,0:04:30.88,Main,,0,0,0,,I want you to look after him, too.Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.38,0:04:34.49,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, Luffy, say "hi" to them.Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.49,0:04:35.32,Main,,0,0,0,,Yo!Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.32,0:04:38.02,Main,,0,0,0,,Who is that kid?Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.02,0:04:40.66,Main,,0,0,0,,He's my grandson.Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.66,0:04:41.39,Main,,0,0,0,,What?Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.39,0:04:43.66,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.66,0:04:45.28,Main,,0,0,0,,Another one?!Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.28,0:04:49.74,Main,,0,0,0,,He's Garp's... I mean, Garp-san's grandson?!Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.74,0:04:51.04,Main,,0,0,0,,We can't!Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.04,0:04:53.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Alright then, here's your choice.Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.40,0:04:56.51,Main,,0,0,0,,Do you wanna spend the rest of your life in a cell or raise him?Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.51,0:05:00.38,Main,,0,0,0,,I've overlooked who knows how many of your crimes.Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.00,0:05:03.85,Main,,0,0,0,,Come on!Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.85,0:05:06.82,Main,,0,0,0,,Well, I don't wanna get arrested but...Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.82,0:05:12.41,Main,,0,0,0,,Sometimes, I think that maybe it's better to be in prison than to take care of Ace.Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.41,0:05:17.70,Main,,0,0,0,,But you want us to look after your grandson, too? I bet he's also a monster.Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.70,0:05:19.21,Main,,0,0,0,,What a crappy shack!Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.21,0:05:21.38,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll wallop ya!Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.38,0:05:22.47,Main,,0,0,0,,He's not even listening! Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.47,0:05:24.68,Main,,0,0,0,,Boss! Are you alright?!Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.68,0:05:28.07,Main,,0,0,0,,What is it?! Ugh, spit! Gross!Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.72,0:05:29.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Who did that?!Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.14,0:05:32.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, you!Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.21,0:05:35.77,Main,,0,0,0,,Say "sorry"! It's gross!Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.77,0:05:37.35,Main,,0,0,0,,Ace!Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.35,0:05:39.51,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you back, Ace?Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.08,0:05:45.32,Captions,,0,0,0,,Portgas D. Ace         (10 Years Ago)Dialogue: 1,0:05:41.08,0:05:45.32,Captions,,0,0,0,,Portgas D. Ace         (10 Years Ago)Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.32,0:05:46.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, say "sorry"!Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.76,0:05:53.62,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy, this is Ace. He's three years older than you. Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.62,0:05:56.43,Main,,0,0,0,,You're gonna live here with them starting today.Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.95,0:05:58.90,Main,,0,0,0,,What?! You can't just decide that!Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.55,0:06:05.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Be nice!Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.71,0:06:06.81,Main,,0,0,0,,Is that final?!Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.81,0:06:08.85,Main,,0,0,0,,Got a problem?Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.33,0:06:12.98,Main,,0,0,0,,We'll take him!Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.82,0:06:15.74,Main,,0,0,0,,It's your turn to wash dishes!Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.14,0:06:18.43,Main,,0,0,0,,Can I have some more, pops!Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.43,0:06:20.59,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm a woman!Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.59,0:06:23.87,Main,,0,0,0,,Do you even know where you are now?!Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.87,0:06:24.50,Main,,0,0,0,,No.Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.50,0:06:25.98,Main,,0,0,0,,Then I'll tell you.Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.98,0:06:29.84,Main,,0,0,0,,This is a den of the Dadan Family, mountain bandits that rule Mount Colubo!Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.84,0:06:33.57,Main,,0,0,0,,Mountain bandits? I hate mountain bandits!Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.24,0:06:40.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Shut it, you little brat! Getting saddled with a punk like you is nothing but trouble!Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.21,0:06:42.32,Main,,0,0,0,,If you don't wanna stay here, that's fine!Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.32,0:06:44.87,Main,,0,0,0,,Get lost and die like a dog!Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.87,0:06:46.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Take it easy, Boss.Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.58,0:06:48.45,Main,,0,0,0,,I wanna eat more.Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.12,0:06:52.42,Main,,0,0,0,,I want some of that meat, too.Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.72,0:07:03.90,Main,,0,0,0,,These are all from a bison that Ace brought.Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.90,0:07:07.14,Main,,0,0,0,,He gave us a cut of the take so everybody can eat.Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.14,0:07:09.09,Main,,0,0,0,,The life of a mountain bandit is rough.Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.09,0:07:12.05,Main,,0,0,0,,Starting tomorrow, you're gonna have to work pretty hard!Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.05,0:07:16.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Cleaning, laundry, polishing shoes and weapons,Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.44,0:07:19.19,Main,,0,0,0,,burglary, robbery, fraud, and murder!Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.81,0:07:24.76,Main,,0,0,0,,Remember, you can't tell Garp what we make you do!Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.76,0:07:29.46,Main,,0,0,0,,One bowl of rice and one glass of water for a day!Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.46,0:07:31.66,Main,,0,0,0,,That's all I can guarantee you.Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.66,0:07:36.00,Main,,0,0,0,,You gotta get everything else by yourself and grow up on your own.Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.00,0:07:36.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Okay!Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.92,0:07:40.24,Main,,0,0,0,,"Okay"?! Why don't you cry or something?Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.24,0:07:44.05,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm fine because Grandpa threw me into a jungle once,Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.05,0:07:49.51,Main,,0,0,0,,and there was water to drink and frogs, snakes, and mushrooms to eat in the forest!Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.51,0:07:52.95,Main,,0,0,0,,Plus, I'll become a pirate someday,Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.95,0:07:55.00,Main,,0,0,0,,so I've gotta be strong!Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.62,0:07:57.23,Main,,0,0,0,,-Boss! -Are you alright?!Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.23,0:07:58.62,Main,,0,0,0,,What're you doing?!Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.62,0:08:01.20,Main,,0,0,0,,Here we go!Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.16,0:08:04.16,Main,,0,0,0,,Where is he going?!Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.16,0:08:05.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Here we go!Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.91,0:08:08.69,Main,,0,0,0,,Where are you going?!Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.69,0:08:10.64,Main,,0,0,0,,Did you just say "pirate"?Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.64,0:08:12.50,Main,,0,0,0,,He's not even listening!Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.50,0:08:13.77,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey!Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.88,0:08:20.41,Main,,0,0,0,,See? He's too tough!Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.41,0:08:23.01,Main,,0,0,0,,That's why I didn't wanna take care of Garp's grandson!Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.01,0:08:24.78,Main,,0,0,0,,Take it easy, Boss.Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.39,0:08:26.82,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey!Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.55,0:08:29.09,Main,,0,0,0,,Wait for me!Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.26,0:08:32.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey!Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.86,0:08:39.96,Main,,0,0,0,,My name is Luffy! I'm not mad about you spitting on me anymore!Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.74,0:08:46.51,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Why are you laughing?!Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.27,0:08:51.41,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,He only spilled some booze on me. It's nothing worth getting mad over.Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.41,0:08:54.89,Main,,0,0,0,,It's nothing worth getting mad over. Let's be friends!Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.51,0:08:56.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you going somewhere?!Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.39,0:09:06.66,Main,,0,0,0,,It's a dead end!Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.45,0:10:04.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey! Ace is back!Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.00,0:10:05.92,Main,,0,0,0,,He brought food!Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.54,0:10:10.23,Main,,0,0,0,,Ace, did you come back alone?Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.23,0:10:13.97,Main,,0,0,0,,Where is Luffy? I thought that you were with him.Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.96,0:10:15.01,Main,,0,0,0,,Dunno.Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.90,0:10:20.70,Main,,0,0,0,,-Get hold of yourself, Boss! -What did you say?!Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.70,0:10:24.46,Main,,0,0,0,,I said it's unacceptable that we lost him on the first day!Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.46,0:10:27.97,Main,,0,0,0,,Who cares! If he dies, he dies!Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.52,0:10:33.19,Main,,0,0,0,,I've already given up on Ace, anyway!Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.96,0:10:39.30,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't care if he dies or not. I'll just tell Garp it was an accident.Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.30,0:10:43.36,Main,,0,0,0,,It's true that "the devil's children have the devil's luck"!Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.36,0:10:45.67,Main,,0,0,0,,He's the devil's son!Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.28,0:10:52.71,Main,,0,0,0,,If the government finds out about this, what do you think they'd do to us?!Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.71,0:10:54.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Take it easy, Boss.Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.50,0:10:58.48,Main,,0,0,0,,You're drinking too much!Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.69,0:11:02.45,Narrator,,0,0,0,,One week later...Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.99,0:11:05.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Boss! Boss Dadan!Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.29,0:11:08.09,Main,,0,0,0,,Who is it?Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.83,0:11:13.03,Main,,0,0,0,,-You! -Luffy came back!Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.04,0:11:22.97,Main,,0,0,0,,You're alive! Why you little...!Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.97,0:11:24.53,Main,,0,0,0,,Take it easy, Boss.Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.53,0:11:26.82,Main,,0,0,0,,Where were you?!Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.82,0:11:30.18,Main,,0,0,0,,Take it easy. Where were you and what were you doing?Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.59,0:11:34.05,Main,,0,0,0,,Wolves were chasing me through the valley.Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.05,0:11:37.32,Main,,0,0,0,,What were you doing in the valley?Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.59,0:11:43.88,Main,,0,0,0,,-Anyway, it's nice that you're okay. -Yeah.Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.88,0:11:48.06,Main,,0,0,0,,It's not okay! The pest came back!Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.93,0:11:53.89,Main,,0,0,0,,Just go to bed already! I'll start working you like a dog tomorrow!Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.89,0:11:54.84,Main,,0,0,0,,Already?Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.84,0:12:04.90,Main,,0,0,0,,Morning!Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.90,0:12:07.78,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you gonna go somewhere today, Ace?Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.78,0:12:11.57,Main,,0,0,0,,Take me with you! Let's be friends!Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.36,0:12:13.62,Main,,0,0,0,,Wait for me!Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.62,0:12:16.16,Main,,0,0,0,,Boss! He's going after Ace again!Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.71,0:12:21.01,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey! You got chores to do!Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.88,0:12:25.06,Main,,0,0,0,,No way!Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.07,0:12:27.53,Main,,0,0,0,,You little turd! He doesn't listen to a damn thing!Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.53,0:12:28.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Take it easy, Boss.Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.88,0:12:31.51,Main,,0,0,0,,-Bring him back right now! -Yes, ma'am.Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.51,0:12:33.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey!Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.15,0:12:53.73,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Even though he always lost track of Ace,Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.26,0:12:59.32,Narrator,,0,0,0,,he kept chasing after him day after day.Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.32,0:13:01.43,Main,,0,0,0,,Ace!Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.24,0:13:10.87,Narrator,,0,0,0,,For one month...Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.21,0:13:13.61,Narrator,,0,0,0,,For two months...Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.61,0:13:15.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Ace!Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.46,0:13:19.20,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Whether rainy or windy...Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.46,0:13:23.35,Main,,0,0,0,,Ace!Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.35,0:13:27.06,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Luffy was relentless in his pursuit of Ace.Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.16,0:13:35.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Ace!Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.38,0:13:47.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Ace! Hey!Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.08,0:13:50.85,Main,,0,0,0,,I can't believe he made it this far. He's so stubborn.Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.79,0:13:54.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh crap!Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.89,0:13:58.97,Main,,0,0,0,,Damn! I lost him again! He's so fast!Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.66,0:14:01.39,Main,,0,0,0,,Is that you, Ace?!Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.17,0:14:15.01,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,That's the beast of Mount Colubo! He's got no chance!Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.58,0:14:20.15,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Why isn't he running?! It's gonna eat him!Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.36,0:14:24.29,Main,,0,0,0,,M-My legs won't move!Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.84,0:14:26.17,Main,,0,0,0,,That twerp!Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.72,0:15:34.54,Narrator,,0,0,0,,After three months of cuts, bruises, and endless pursuit...Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.63,0:15:43.78,Main,,0,0,0,,It's the edge of the forest.Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.39,0:15:52.24,Main,,0,0,0,,It stinks! What's with this place?Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.49,0:15:58.97,Narrator,,0,0,0,,A neglected place lies north of Mount Colubo, where the Dadan Family lives.Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.76,0:16:05.15,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Smoke emanates from heaps of discarded trash.Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.15,0:16:08.62,Narrator,,0,0,0,,The useless and unwanted accumulate here.Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.34,0:16:15.10,Narrator,,0,0,0,,The inhabitants are all outlaws who have been banished from the kingdom.Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.10,0:16:18.00,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Naturally, the law has no sway here.Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.71,0:16:22.72,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Without so much as a doctor, the area is rampant with both crime and disease.Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.72,0:16:26.30,Narrator,,0,0,0,,This is the Gray Terminal.Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.83,0:16:28.85,Main,,0,0,0,,Treasure... Treasure...Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.85,0:16:31.65,Main,,0,0,0,,There ain't nothing worth pawning here.Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.94,0:16:35.83,Main,,0,0,0,,I found some pearls!Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.83,0:16:37.48,Main,,0,0,0,,Hand it over!Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.48,0:16:38.84,Main,,0,0,0,,No, it's mine!Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.84,0:16:40.71,Main,,0,0,0,,You gotta be kidding! I found it!Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.71,0:16:43.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't touch it, you bastards!Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.00,0:16:45.73,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna take it to town and sell it!Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.73,0:16:46.98,Main,,0,0,0,,I won't let you have it!Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.98,0:16:48.39,Main,,0,0,0,,Wait!Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.35,0:16:58.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Damn you!Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.33,0:16:59.01,Main,,0,0,0,,Give it to me!Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.55,0:17:05.86,Main,,0,0,0,,You wouldn't have gotten hurt if you had just given it to me right away.Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.65,0:17:08.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Good job!Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.67,0:17:09.87,Main,,0,0,0,,Why, you...Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.87,0:17:10.89,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you kidding me?!Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.46,0:17:15.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Thief!Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.31,0:17:22.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Get outta my way, kid!Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.96,0:17:27.52,Main,,0,0,0,,Hurry it up! Move or I'll...Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.52,0:17:29.87,Main,,0,0,0,,He went that way!Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.49,0:17:37.55,Main,,0,0,0,,Sabo! Sabo, are you there?Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.28,0:17:42.02,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, Ace!Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.59,0:17:44.57,Main,,0,0,0,,Sorry I'm late.Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.57,0:17:46.16,Main,,0,0,0,,You sure are!Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.49,0:17:49.48,Main,,0,0,0,,I've already finished a job in town.Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.75,0:17:51.29,Captions,,0,0,0,,Sabo   (Age 10)         (A Boy Living in Gray Terminal)Dialogue: 1,0:17:46.75,0:17:51.29,Captions,,0,0,0,,Sabo   (Age 10)         (A Boy Living in Gray Terminal)Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.15,0:17:55.20,Main,,0,0,0,,Really? Truth is, I did, too.Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.20,0:17:57.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Here we go!Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.00,0:18:00.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Amazing! You've got even more than me!Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.63,0:18:03.35,Main,,0,0,0,,This is a lot of treasure! How'd you get it?Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.81,0:18:07.41,Main,,0,0,0,,I stole it from some thugs near the main gate.Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.85,0:18:10.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Damn! You beat me again today.Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.23,0:18:13.19,Main,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter who wins, does it?Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.01,0:18:16.62,Main,,0,0,0,,We're gonna spend the pirate fund together one day.Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.62,0:18:19.66,Main,,0,0,0,,It must be five years since we started saving, huh?Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.71,0:18:23.73,Main,,0,0,0,,We've worked hard.Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.29,0:18:26.70,Main,,0,0,0,,We sure have!Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.74,0:18:32.49,Main,,0,0,0,,The thought of leaving the East Blue and heading out to a world these hicks couldn't dream of...Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.50,0:18:35.24,Main,,0,0,0,,gets me so pumped!Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.32,0:18:45.51,Main,,0,0,0,,Hurry and close the lid. We don't know who might be watching.Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.51,0:18:49.88,Main,,0,0,0,,I wonder how much we need to buy a pirate ship?Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.87,0:18:53.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Who knows... Hundreds of thousands, or maybe even millions...Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.71,0:18:55.31,Main,,0,0,0,,Whatever it is, we still got a long way to go.Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.31,0:18:56.79,Main,,0,0,0,,A pirate ship?!Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.39,0:19:01.36,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you guys gonna be pirates?!Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.36,0:19:03.80,Main,,0,0,0,,Me too!Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.80,0:19:05.03,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey!Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.87,0:19:16.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Be quiet!Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.52,0:19:23.64,Main,,0,0,0,,Ace! So this is where you've been going every day?Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.64,0:19:24.85,Main,,0,0,0,,Shut up.Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.26,0:19:28.69,Main,,0,0,0,,So this is that pest Luffy you mentioned?Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.62,0:19:31.32,Main,,0,0,0,,You've been telling him about me?Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.32,0:19:33.85,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I've been complaining about how clingy you are!Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.85,0:19:37.70,Main,,0,0,0,,And how you never think about what you're doing!Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.42,0:19:39.42,Main,,0,0,0,,I see!Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.42,0:19:42.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Doesn't he realize that we're insulting him?Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.67,0:19:45.64,Main,,0,0,0,,He finally made it all the way here.Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.64,0:19:48.54,Main,,0,0,0,,And I even made sure to avoid the paths most people use.Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.54,0:19:51.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey you! Are you Ace's friend?Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.29,0:19:52.88,Main,,0,0,0,,We're buds, too, right?Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.88,0:19:56.55,Main,,0,0,0,,Shut up! We don't even know each other!Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.55,0:19:58.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Then, what's your name?Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.40,0:19:59.20,Main,,0,0,0,,Sa-Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.20,0:20:00.04,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm not telling you!Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.82,0:20:04.18,Main,,0,0,0,,This is why I said you should just live here!Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.18,0:20:08.10,Main,,0,0,0,,It's such a pain that, every day, you've gotta go back and forth through the mountain for your "training."Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.76,0:20:10.01,Main,,0,0,0,,What are we gonna do?Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.40,0:20:13.64,Main,,0,0,0,,Now that he knows our secret,Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.64,0:20:16.66,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm sure he'll just tell everyone if we let him go.Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.26,0:20:24.30,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's kill him.Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.30,0:20:26.20,Main,,0,0,0,,Right. Good idea.Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.09,0:20:33.48,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't kill me!Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.48,0:20:35.45,Main,,0,0,0,,Someone save me!Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.45,0:20:36.88,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't wanna die!Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.88,0:20:38.82,Main,,0,0,0,,You idiot! Be quiet!Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.82,0:20:41.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Sabo! Hurry and do it!Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.29,0:20:43.22,Main,,0,0,0,,Why do I have to do it?! You do it!Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.22,0:20:45.54,Main,,0,0,0,,I've never killed anyone before!Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.54,0:20:48.47,Main,,0,0,0,,Neither have I! I don't know how to do it!Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.47,0:20:51.41,Main,,0,0,0,,Please don't drop me in the water!Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.41,0:20:52.85,Main,,0,0,0,,Right! The river!Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.85,0:20:55.30,Main,,0,0,0,,Why'd he tell us?Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.30,0:20:56.33,Main,,0,0,0,,'Cause he's a moron!Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.33,0:20:58.87,Main,,0,0,0,,Somebody help me!Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.87,0:21:00.52,Main,,0,0,0,,Shut up!Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.71,0:21:04.92,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't wanna die!Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.46,0:21:08.81,Main,,0,0,0,,I heard a voice from the forest. A child's voice!Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.81,0:21:11.18,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh no! Someone's coming!Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.18,0:21:13.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's just untie him!Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.40,0:21:16.19,Main,,0,0,0,,If we don't get away from here, they'll find our treasure!Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.91,0:21:22.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Those brats, Ace and Sabo, are pretty notorious around these parts.Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.68,0:21:28.34,Captions,,0,0,0,,Porchemy        Bluejam PiratesDialogue: 1,0:21:23.68,0:21:28.34,Captions,,0,0,0,,Porchemy        Bluejam PiratesDialogue: 0,0:21:23.60,0:21:25.89,Main,,0,0,0,,You're absolutely certain...Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.89,0:21:28.35,Main,,0,0,0,,it was Ace who swiped the cash, right?Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.35,0:21:32.99,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's so embarrassing. We let our guard down.Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.99,0:21:35.08,Main,,0,0,0,,I can't believe that kid!Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.08,0:21:38.02,Main,,0,0,0,,Laying his hands on our crew's loot!Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.58,0:21:43.66,Main,,0,0,0,,If Captain Bluejam hears about this, we're all dead!Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.32,0:21:50.09,Main,,0,0,0,,Damn it! Those thugs were Bluejam's mules?Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.09,0:21:53.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Thugs? You mean you got that money from those guys?Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.81,0:21:56.63,Main,,0,0,0,,We've got some dangerous money on our hands.Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.64,0:22:00.64,Main,,0,0,0,,That guy carrying the sword is Bluejam's underling, Porchemy.Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.38,0:22:04.41,Main,,0,0,0,,He's nuts. Have you heard?Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.48,0:22:09.65,Main,,0,0,0,,When he beats someone, he scalps them alive!Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.54,0:22:16.32,Main,,0,0,0,,We've gotta lay low.Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.82,0:22:19.36,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh? Where'd he go?Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.13,0:22:23.97,Main,,0,0,0,,Let go of me! What're you doing?Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.97,0:22:26.14,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,How'd he get caught?!Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.80,0:22:28.45,Main,,0,0,0,,Who is this kid?Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.45,0:22:29.64,Main,,0,0,0,,Help me!Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.64,0:22:31.26,Main,,0,0,0,,Ace!Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.82,0:22:35.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Please save me, Ace!Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.25,0:22:38.39,Main,,0,0,0,,That idiot! He shouted my name!Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.21,0:22:42.12,Main,,0,0,0,,Did you just say Ace?Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.42,0:22:44.19,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah, so?Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.19,0:22:47.39,Main,,0,0,0,,Do you know Ace?Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.86,0:22:50.20,Main,,0,0,0,,He's my friend!Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.11,0:22:53.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, but he was going to kill me just now.Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.36,0:22:58.27,Main,,0,0,0,,He never shuts up!Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.82,0:23:00.69,Main,,0,0,0,,I've got a question for you.Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.69,0:23:05.97,Main,,0,0,0,,Earlier today, Ace stole our money and got away.Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.97,0:23:09.21,Main,,0,0,0,,You wouldn't happen to know where he is, would you?Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.59,0:23:16.84,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, crap! They're gonna take our treasure!Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.84,0:23:19.18,Main,,0,0,0,,That shrimp better not tell 'em nothing!Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.65,0:23:31.60,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't know.Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.44,0:23:34.17,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,What a terrible liar!Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.36,0:23:42.47,Main,,0,0,0,,Alright, then. If you don't know, then that's that.Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.60,0:23:49.25,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll help you remember, so don't worry!Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.52,0:23:53.54,Main,,0,0,0,,What the hell?! Let me go!  Where are you taking me?!Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.54,0:23:56.39,Main,,0,0,0,,Damn it! Idiot! Let go of me!Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.39,0:23:57.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Idiot!Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.28,0:23:59.67,Main,,0,0,0,,What are we gonna do?Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.67,0:24:02.40,Main,,0,0,0,,What are we gonna do? Well...Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.74,0:24:12.41,Main,,0,0,0,,Let me go!Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.41,0:24:14.41,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm not telling you anything!Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.72,0:24:24.75,Main,,0,0,0,,You damn kid!Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.84,0:24:42.44,Main,,0,0,0,,I tried to tell you, I'm rubbery because I ate the Rubber Rubber Fruit!Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.96,0:24:44.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Quiet!Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.51,0:24:47.65,Main,,0,0,0,,A devil fruit, huh?Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.08,0:24:51.52,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're the real deal.Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.62,0:24:55.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Get my gloves.Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.17,0:24:57.15,Main,,0,0,0,,Y-Yes, sir!Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.15,0:25:01.35,Main,,0,0,0,,Hurry! Hurry up! If Porchemy and the others come back, we're done for!Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.35,0:25:04.28,Main,,0,0,0,,We've gotta move the treasure somewhere else, and fast!Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.88,0:25:08.32,Main,,0,0,0,,It's only a matter of time before that Luffy guy spills the beans!Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.32,0:25:11.69,Main,,0,0,0,,If they find this, they won't just take back what we stole from them,Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.69,0:25:15.89,Main,,0,0,0,,they'll steal everything we gathered these past five years!Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.35,0:25:26.09,Main,,0,0,0,,Listen up, you brat! The cash that your friend Ace stole...Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.09,0:25:29.07,Main,,0,0,0,,was important to our pirate crew!Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.88,0:25:32.38,Main,,0,0,0,,And you know where they hid it!Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.38,0:25:34.88,Main,,0,0,0,,I will make you tell me!Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.26,0:25:37.05,Main,,0,0,0,,Never!Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.79,0:25:46.77,Main,,0,0,0,,That's gotta hurt!Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.93,0:25:53.91,Main,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't piss off a pirate!Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.33,0:25:59.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Our captain, Bluejam, is inhumanly brutal!Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.56,0:26:10.75,Main,,0,0,0,,That hurt! I'm scared! Somebody save me!Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.05,0:26:15.92,Main,,0,0,0,,You guys, go search for Ace and Sabo!Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.92,0:26:18.52,Main,,0,0,0,,We don't have time for you to just stand around here!Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.52,0:26:19.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.95,0:26:31.01,Main,,0,0,0,,You want to know where Ace and Sabo are?Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.01,0:26:34.15,Main,,0,0,0,,You guys are delinquents from town, aren't you?Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.80,0:26:37.75,Main,,0,0,0,,You're better off not getting involved with those two.Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.62,0:26:41.31,Main,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't underestimate them just 'cause they're kids!Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.31,0:26:44.28,Main,,0,0,0,,They're a pair of mad dogs who can even kill tigers!Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.28,0:26:47.57,Main,,0,0,0,,Ace and Sabo, huh? I haven't seen 'em.Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.24,0:26:50.84,Main,,0,0,0,,But more importantly, pal,Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.84,0:26:53.79,Main,,0,0,0,,why don't you hand over your valuables?Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.79,0:26:55.49,Main,,0,0,0,,P-Please don't!Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.49,0:26:57.47,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's go look somewhere else!Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.63,0:27:02.64,Main,,0,0,0,,The sun's already setting.Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.30,0:27:05.31,Main,,0,0,0,,Alright, I'm done!Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.31,0:27:07.65,Main,,0,0,0,,I've moved all of the treasure!Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.46,0:27:13.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Ace!Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.10,0:27:15.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Sabo, what's wrong?Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.00,0:27:17.05,Main,,0,0,0,,Have they gone to our old hideout to look for the money?Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.60,0:27:21.75,Main,,0,0,0,,No, they haven't.Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.24,0:27:24.12,Main,,0,0,0,,There's no way they'd know where to go!Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.01,0:27:25.92,Main,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.92,0:27:28.33,Main,,0,0,0,,That Luffy guy...Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.36,0:27:31.66,Main,,0,0,0,,still hasn't told them a thing!Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.26,0:27:36.16,Main,,0,0,0,,He's definitely being tortured.Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.16,0:27:40.34,Main,,0,0,0,,I thought that he would spill the beans right away since he's such a crybaby and an idiot.Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.34,0:27:41.67,Main,,0,0,0,,This doesn't make any sense!Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.77,0:27:45.38,Main,,0,0,0,,At this rate, he'll...Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.95,0:27:57.23,Captions,,0,0,0,,Gray Terminal         Pirate BayDialogue: 1,0:27:52.95,0:27:57.23,Captions,,0,0,0,,Gray Terminal         Pirate BayDialogue: 0,0:27:54.39,0:27:57.22,Main,,0,0,0,,They're late...Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.22,0:27:59.99,Main,,0,0,0,,Who was in charge today?Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.59,0:28:03.89,Main,,0,0,0,,It was Porchemy, Captain Bluejam.Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.61,0:28:06.86,Main,,0,0,0,,The sun is already setting.Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.57,0:28:14.27,Main,,0,0,0,,They should have finished pawning it all by now.Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.86,0:28:18.97,Main,,0,0,0,,You think the bastard has taken off with the money?Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.00,0:28:18.97,Captions,,0,0,0,,Captain Bluejam         Bluejam PiratesDialogue: 1,0:28:15.00,0:28:18.97,Captions,,0,0,0,,Captain Bluejam         Bluejam PiratesDialogue: 0,0:28:18.97,0:28:21.05,Main,,0,0,0,,No, there's no way!Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.05,0:28:24.52,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm sure he values his life!Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.14,0:28:27.99,Main,,0,0,0,,You're right.Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.69,0:28:35.76,Main,,0,0,0,,Just tell me already!Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.07,0:28:41.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Porchemy-san!Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.71,0:28:44.00,Main,,0,0,0,,It's no use!Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.78,0:28:50.04,Main,,0,0,0,,He doesn't even have enough energy to scream!Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.68,0:29:00.44,Main,,0,0,0,,He probably won't tell us anything and, to be honest, this is so brutal I can barely watch!Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.44,0:29:03.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's just let him go!Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.70,0:29:09.77,Main,,0,0,0,,If you have the time to worry about the kid, then go find Ace and Sabo!Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.25,0:29:14.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Our lives are on the line here! Don't you get it?!Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.10,0:29:19.74,Main,,0,0,0,,The scheduled drop-off with Captain Bluejam is long overdue!Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.50,0:29:28.84,Main,,0,0,0,,Poor kid. Should we call the sheriff from town?Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.84,0:29:32.78,Main,,0,0,0,,It's useless. The country's laws don't mean anything out here.Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.78,0:29:36.72,Main,,0,0,0,,Besides, that guy is a member of Bluejam's crew.Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.72,0:29:39.36,Main,,0,0,0,,They pay off the nobles!Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.36,0:29:44.37,Main,,0,0,0,,Whatever crimes they commit here, even murder, are overlooked!Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.00,0:29:49.81,Main,,0,0,0,,No matter how many corpses pile up around here, nobody will pay any attention!Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.00,0:29:53.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Answer me!Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.07,0:29:55.68,Main,,0,0,0,,I won't!Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.31,0:30:01.38,Main,,0,0,0,,You damned brat! Spill it already!Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.16,0:30:07.77,Main,,0,0,0,,Talk!Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.05,0:30:11.79,Main,,0,0,0,,I won't.Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.64,0:30:13.99,Main,,0,0,0,,I won't!Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.65,0:30:16.27,Main,,0,0,0,,I won't tell you!Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.81,0:30:21.62,Main,,0,0,0,,I won't tell you!Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.12,0:30:26.07,Main,,0,0,0,,Fine. I don't care anymore!Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.72,0:30:46.15,Main,,0,0,0,,Die.Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.16,0:30:52.55,Main,,0,0,0,,Stop!Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.80,0:30:58.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Outta my way!Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.81,0:31:06.98,Main,,0,0,0,,-It's him, Porchemy-san! -He stole the money from us! Damn you!Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.98,0:31:08.05,Main,,0,0,0,,What?Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.05,0:31:10.31,Main,,0,0,0,,A-Ace!Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.76,0:31:19.50,Main,,0,0,0,,You saved us time by coming here yourselves!Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.50,0:31:23.51,Main,,0,0,0,,We were having a hard time making your friend talk.Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.51,0:31:24.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Ace!Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.54,0:31:26.82,Main,,0,0,0,,L-Let me go!Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.82,0:31:28.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Sabo!Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.20,0:31:33.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Porchemy-san!Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.11,0:31:38.51,Main,,0,0,0,,Ace! Sabo!Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.51,0:31:42.05,Main,,0,0,0,,That kind of hurts. Hey!Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.97,0:31:47.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Do you know what happens when you mess with grownups?!Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.65,0:31:52.26,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll fight you! Sabo, help him!Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.26,0:31:53.36,Main,,0,0,0,,Ace!Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.52,0:31:57.53,Main,,0,0,0,,He has a sword! Be careful!Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.04,0:32:11.34,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, he got the knife!Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.80,0:32:13.48,Main,,0,0,0,,Porchemy-san, that kid...Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.95,0:32:18.95,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's go, Ace!Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.95,0:32:20.28,Main,,0,0,0,,Go ahead!Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.81,0:32:23.35,Main,,0,0,0,,You idiot! Hurry up!Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.92,0:32:28.13,Main,,0,0,0,,When I face someone, I never run!Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.13,0:32:30.74,Main,,0,0,0,,What'd you say?! You little brat!Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.74,0:32:34.34,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't do it! He's not like the thugs in the city!Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.81,0:32:36.70,Main,,0,0,0,,You got that right!Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.70,0:32:41.76,Main,,0,0,0,,Alright! Enough playing around! It's our cash.Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.76,0:32:44.55,Main,,0,0,0,,Just shut up and give it back, brat!Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.55,0:32:47.05,Main,,0,0,0,,What possessed you to steal from us?Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.05,0:32:50.11,Main,,0,0,0,,Give the money back, and you won't regret it.Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.47,0:32:55.39,Main,,0,0,0,,We have better plans for that money!Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.45,0:32:57.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Wh...Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.51,0:33:00.26,Main,,0,0,0,,What did you say?!Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.26,0:33:02.99,Main,,0,0,0,,Wait here a minute!Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.89,0:33:05.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Stop fooling around!Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.63,0:33:14.94,Main,,0,0,0,,If I'm beaten by kids, I may as well quit being a pirate!Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.94,0:33:17.77,Main,,0,0,0,,-We'll make sure you quit! -We'll make sure you quit!Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.88,0:33:20.08,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna kill all of you!Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.82,0:33:34.03,Main,,0,0,0,,I heard the whole story, Porchemy. How pathetic.Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.03,0:33:37.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Did you honestly get beaten by kids?Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.24,0:33:42.92,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Captain Bluejam. The money is...Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.92,0:33:45.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't look at me! I don't even want to see your face!Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.43,0:34:00.09,Main,,0,0,0,,That's a real bad habit, Ace!Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.09,0:34:03.98,Main,,0,0,0,,When facing a real pirate, it's best to run!Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.98,0:34:06.12,Main,,0,0,0,,Why do you have such a death wish?Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.12,0:34:09.76,Main,,0,0,0,,This doesn't feel right. I liked the one I had.Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.03,0:34:17.90,Main,,0,0,0,,We made a stupid mistake. The Bluejam crew won't forgive us.Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.90,0:34:19.34,Main,,0,0,0,,They'll come after us!Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.34,0:34:23.27,Main,,0,0,0,,That was so scary! I thought I was gonna die!Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.14,0:34:31.06,Main,,0,0,0,,You're so annoying! Shut up! Stop crying already!Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.06,0:34:35.49,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't like cowards or crybabies!Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.63,0:34:39.23,Main,,0,0,0,,Th-Thank you!Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.83,0:34:43.88,Main,,0,0,0,,You...Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.13,0:34:47.13,Main,,0,0,0,,You saved me!Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.13,0:34:50.93,Main,,0,0,0,,-You...! -Whoa, he's just being thankful.Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.39,0:34:58.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you cough it up in the first place?Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.40,0:35:02.22,Main,,0,0,0,,They're the kind of people who'd kill women or kids without hesitation!Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.19,0:35:07.83,Main,,0,0,0,,I thought if I said anything, you wouldn't be my friend.Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.53,0:35:10.86,Main,,0,0,0,,It's better than dying, isn't it?Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.86,0:35:13.36,Main,,0,0,0,,Why do you wanna be my friend that bad?Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.62,0:35:16.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Because...Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.22,0:35:21.66,Main,,0,0,0,,I put you through hell, remember?Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.66,0:35:24.19,Main,,0,0,0,,Why would you follow me this far?Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.86,0:35:31.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Because...Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.21,0:35:35.32,Main,,0,0,0,,Because I have nobody else!Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.04,0:35:40.00,Main,,0,0,0,,I can't go back to Foosha Village, and I hate mountain bandits!Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.00,0:35:43.48,Main,,0,0,0,,If I didn't follow you, I'd be all alone!Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.48,0:35:46.73,Main,,0,0,0,,Being lonely is more painful than getting hurt!Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.46,0:35:50.59,Main,,0,0,0,,Where are your parents?Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.59,0:35:52.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Grandpa is all I have.Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.46,0:35:56.32,Main,,0,0,0,,So you feel better when I'm around?Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.32,0:35:57.81,Main,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.81,0:36:00.57,Main,,0,0,0,,-It's hard without me? -Uh-huh.Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.52,0:36:06.40,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,If Gold Roger had a child?Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.41,0:36:10.11,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Hopefully, such a child doesn't exist!Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.11,0:36:15.75,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,He'd be some kind of devil who'd be better off dead!Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.28,0:36:24.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Do you want me to live?Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.20,0:36:29.66,Main,,0,0,0,,Of course I do!Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.01,0:36:32.30,Main,,0,0,0,,I see.Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.72,0:36:39.08,Main,,0,0,0,,But I don't like spoiled kids like you.Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.99,0:36:44.12,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm not spoiled! I'm strong!Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.12,0:36:48.65,Main,,0,0,0,,Strong?! You're not strong at all!  You cry like a girl!Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.65,0:36:53.30,Main,,0,0,0,,Have you ever gotten hit  with spikes? I'm only seven!Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.30,0:36:58.32,Main,,0,0,0,,When I'm ten like you, I'll stop crying and be even stronger!Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.32,0:37:02.27,Main,,0,0,0,,I never cried when I was seven, stupid! I'm not like you!Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.27,0:37:05.44,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna be stronger than everyone!Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.44,0:37:09.49,Main,,0,0,0,,I promised Shanks that I'd become a great pirate!Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.49,0:37:11.61,Main,,0,0,0,,-You? A pirate? -Yes!Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.61,0:37:12.78,Main,,0,0,0,,-No way! -Yes way!Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.56,0:37:17.01,Main,,0,0,0,,Okay, that's enough!Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.66,0:37:21.99,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, by the way, I have a little problem.Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.99,0:37:23.30,Main,,0,0,0,,-What? A problem? -Uh-huh.Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.50,0:37:29.73,Main,,0,0,0,,I've been living in this forest, but it's too close to their hideout in Pirate Bay.Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.73,0:37:34.66,Main,,0,0,0,,What if they attack me when I'm exhausted and falling asleep?Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.91,0:37:38.04,Main,,0,0,0,,That's why I need your help.Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.68,0:37:58.19,Main,,0,0,0,,What happened? They're all bandaged!Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.41,0:38:02.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, that's...Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.63,0:38:10.20,Main,,0,0,0,,Whoa! Boss! Boss! We have a problem!Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.20,0:38:12.78,Main,,0,0,0,,Hmm? It's still early. What's wrong...Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.78,0:38:16.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Whoa! What's going on here?!Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.75,0:38:18.78,Main,,0,0,0,,1, 2...Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.38,0:38:24.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Ace! Luffy! Who is that?!Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.13,0:38:27.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Who is who?Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.69,0:38:33.99,Main,,0,0,0,,Why is there one more kid?!Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.99,0:38:35.26,Main,,0,0,0,,Who the hell are you?!Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.99,0:38:37.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you talking about me?Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.11,0:38:42.43,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm Sabo! Hey, you must be Dadan!Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.43,0:38:45.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Sabo? I've heard your name before!Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.71,0:38:50.27,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah? That makes it easier! Thank you for taking me in!Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.27,0:38:54.95,Main,,0,0,0,,I heard that you're nothing but a troublemaking urchin!Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.95,0:38:58.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah? I heard that you're nothing but an annoying old bag, too!Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.08,0:39:11.39,Main,,0,0,0,,Ace! Luffy! Sabo!Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.39,0:39:15.43,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm giving you a place to stay! You gotta get to work already!Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.93,0:39:19.11,Main,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Dadan!Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.00,0:39:33.09,Narrator,,0,0,0,,After being forced to leave the Gray Terminal,Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.09,0:39:35.85,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Ace's best friend Sabo moved in.Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.24,0:39:40.08,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Ace, Sabo, and Luffy.Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.09,0:39:43.74,Narrator,,0,0,0,,The trio soon began spending their time...Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.74,0:39:46.33,Narrator,,0,0,0,,fighting wild animals in the mountains and the jungle.Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.88,0:39:51.40,Narrator,,0,0,0,,They also clashed with hooligans from the city and pirates at the bay.Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.84,0:39:56.33,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Eventually, even people living in the heart of the city...Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.33,0:39:58.94,Narrator,,0,0,0,,came to know their mischief!Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.59,0:00:22.17,OP14 Translation,,0,0,0,,Let's set sail before the break of dawnDialogue: 0,0:00:22.26,0:00:26.69,OP14 Translation,,0,0,0,,to meet a yet unseen tomorrowDialogue: 0,0:00:26.97,0:00:30.33,OP14 Translation,,0,0,0,,I've made up my mind, and I have no regretsDialogue: 0,0:00:33.51,0:00:37.07,OP14 Translation,,0,0,0,,No matter what trials wait for us along the wayDialogue: 0,0:00:37.21,0:00:41.70,OP14 Translation,,0,0,0,,nothing can ever stop the pounding of our heartsDialogue: 0,0:00:41.81,0:00:46.35,OP14 Translation,,0,0,0,,There is but one place we all aim forDialogue: 0,0:00:48.32,0:00:52.09,OP14 Translation,,0,0,0,,The bonds that we gained at the end of the battleDialogue: 0,0:00:52.16,0:00:55.67,OP14 Translation,,0,0,0,,I will not let anyone damage themDialogue: 0,0:00:55.80,0:00:58.47,OP14 Translation,,0,0,0,,If we open our clenched fistsDialogue: 0,0:00:58.60,0:01:01.71,OP14 Translation,,0,0,0,,we'll find strength within themDialogue: 0,0:01:01.87,0:01:04.13,OP14 Translation,,0,0,0,,So let's get started!Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.27,0:01:09.28,OP14 Translation,,0,0,0,,A brand new world is calling for usDialogue: 0,0:01:09.38,0:01:11.67,OP14 Translation,,0,0,0,,Look ahead!Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.78,0:01:18.02,OP14 Translation,,0,0,0,,Even if countless seas stand between usDialogue: 0,0:01:18.08,0:01:21.79,OP14 Translation,,0,0,0,,we're always supporting each otherDialogue: 0,0:01:21.82,0:01:25.46,OP14 Translation,,0,0,0,,Let's move on without any fearsDialogue: 0,0:01:25.96,0:01:27.85,OP14 Translation,,0,0,0,,Please don't forgetDialogue: 0,0:01:29.86,0:01:37.12,OP14 Translation,,0,0,0,,The great, wide, distant skyDialogue: 0,0:01:37.54,0:01:39.90,OP14 Translation,,0,0,0,,that we looked up to on that dayDialogue: 0,0:01:40.01,0:01:45.02,OP14 Translation,,0,0,0,,has yet to be taintedDialogue: 0,0:01:45.04,0:01:48.45,OP14 Translation,,0,0,0,,We've come quite a long wayDialogue: 0,0:01:48.65,0:01:52.41,OP14 Translation,,0,0,0,,all carrying the vows we made within our heartsDialogue: 0,0:01:52.45,0:01:54.99,OP14 Translation,,0,0,0,,There's nothing to fearDialogue: 0,0:01:55.05,0:01:59.42,OP14 Translation,,0,0,0,,We all have burdens we must carryDialogue: 0,0:01:59.56,0:02:01.88,OP14 Translation,,0,0,0,,The sun risesDialogue: 0,0:02:02.03,0:02:06.84,OP14 Translation,,0,0,0,,and it brightens everything, even my sadnessDialogue: 0,0:02:06.87,0:02:09.24,OP14 Translation,,0,0,0,,I believeDialogue: 0,0:02:09.34,0:02:15.58,OP14 Translation,,0,0,0,,in the future where we'll come together as oneDialogue: 0,0:02:15.71,0:02:19.30,OP14 Translation,,0,0,0,,Let's go find it togetherDialogue: 0,0:02:19.38,0:02:23.11,OP14 Translation,,0,0,0,,There's nobody that can take your placeDialogue: 0,0:02:23.58,0:02:25.24,OP14 Translation,,0,0,0,,Please don't forgetDialogue: 0,0:00:18.07,0:00:22.47,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,m 0 24 b 0 -8 50 -8 50 24 b 50 56 0 56 0 24 "Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.07,0:00:22.47,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,m 0 24 b 0 -8 50 -8 50 24 b 50 56 0 56 0 24 "Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.07,0:00:18.74,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,YoDialogue: 0,0:00:18.74,0:00:19.12,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,YoDialogue: 0,0:00:18.07,0:00:19.24,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,m 0 24 b 0 -8 50 -8 50 24 b 50 56 0 56 0 24 "Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.07,0:00:19.24,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,m 0 24 b 0 -8 50 -8 50 24 b 50 56 0 56 0 24 "Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.07,0:00:22.65,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,m 0 24 b 0 -8 50 -8 50 24 b 50 56 0 56 0 24 "Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.07,0:00:22.65,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,m 0 24 b 0 -8 50 -8 50 24 b 50 56 0 56 0 24 "Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.07,0:00:18.92,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,ruDialogue: 0,0:00:18.92,0:00:19.24,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,ruDialogue: 0,0:00:18.07,0:00:19.42,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,m 0 24 b 0 -8 50 -8 50 24 b 50 56 0 56 0 24 "Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.07,0:00:19.42,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,m 0 24 b 0 -8 50 -8 50 24 b 50 56 0 56 0 24 "Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.07,0:00:22.77,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,m 0 24 b 0 -8 50 -8 50 24 b 50 56 0 56 0 24 "Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.07,0:00:22.77,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,m 0 24 b 0 -8 50 -8 50 24 b 50 56 0 56 0 24 "Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.07,0:00:19.04,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,gaDialogue: 0,0:00:19.04,0:00:19.47,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,gaDialogue: 0,0:00:18.07,0:00:19.54,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,m 0 24 b 0 -8 50 -8 50 24 b 50 56 0 56 0 24 "Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.07,0:00:19.54,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,m 0 24 b 0 -8 50 -8 50 24 b 50 56 0 56 0 24 "Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.07,0:00:23.00,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,m 0 24 b 0 -8 50 -8 50 24 b 50 56 0 56 0 24 "Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.07,0:00:23.00,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,m 0 24 b 0 -8 50 -8 50 24 b 50 56 0 56 0 24 "Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.07,0:00:19.27,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,aDialogue: 0,0:00: